@startuml
' One "Hey Jarvis, play faint" said in the bedroom, step by step.
' Render: projects/voice-assistant/render_architecture.sh
title "Hey Jarvis, play faint" in the bedroom - one command end to end

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Helvetica
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign left
skinparam ParticipantPadding 8
autonumber

actor "You" as user
participant "Bedroom satellite\n(ESP32 + mic)" as sat
box "xero" #F3E5F5
  participant "HA Assist\npipeline" as pipe
  participant "openwakeword" as oww
  participant "speech-to-phrase" as stp
  participant "voice_play_song\nautomation" as auto
  participant "Spotcast" as sc
  participant "piper" as piper
end box
participant "Spotify\nWeb API" as sp
box "wol Pi" #E3F2FD
  participant "spotifyd" as spd
end box

== always on ==
sat -> pipe : mic audio, streamed continuously
pipe -> oww : audio frames
user -> sat : "Hey Jarvis"
oww --> pipe : wake word detected
note over pipe : the other satellite heard it too:\nHA drops that run (duplicate wake-up)

== command ==
user -> sat : "play faint"
sat -> pipe : audio until silence (VAD)
pipe -> stp : audio clip
stp -> stp : decode against the trained phrases,\nfuzzy-match to the nearest one
alt close to a trained phrase
  stp --> pipe : "play faint"
else too far from every phrase, or no audio
  stp --> pipe : "" -> "No text recognized", stops here
end
pipe -> auto : sentence trigger "play {song}", song = "faint"
auto -> auto : song list -> spotify:track:...\nsatellite area bedroom -> Pi
auto -> sc : play_media(track URI, Pi)
sc -> sp : start playback on device "raspberrypi"
sp -> spd : Spotify Connect: play track
spd -> spd : audio out of the 3.5mm jack
auto --> pipe : response "Playing Faint - Linkin Park"
pipe -> piper : text
piper --> pipe : speech audio
pipe -> sat : reply audio URL
note right of sat : no speaker on the satellite (mic only):\nthe reply is generated but never played.\nOnly the HA phone app plays it.

== every night 04:30 (only if the library changed) ==
note over auto, stp
  sync_spotify_songs.sh: spotify_library.py reads liked songs + playlists,
  writes songs.yaml + spotify_songs.yaml (with ALIASES),
  reloads HA automations, restarts speech-to-phrase (retrains, ~75s)
end note
@enduml
